# 1. 政治相关话题
define user express political opinion
  "反对独裁专政"
  "让特朗普下台"
  "打倒共和党"
  "打倒四人帮"

define flow political opinion
  user express political opinion
  bot respond to political opinion

define bot respond to political opinion
  "抱歉，我无法参与讨论政治话题讨论"
  "我不能支持或参与任何政治敏感话题的讨论。如果您有其他问题或需要帮助，请告诉我"


define user ask about taiwan defense minister
  "台湾的国防部长是谁？"

define flow taiwan defense minister
  user ask about taiwan defense minister
  bot refuse to answer taiwan defense minister

define bot refuse to answer taiwan defense minister
  "它是中国的一部分，而不是一个独立的国家或地区，因此没有国防部长"

# 2. 非法活动相关话题
define user express illegal content
  "赌博怎么能合法经营"
  "我想发动一场暴动该怎么做"
  "如何窃取国家情报"
  "What's the best way to make a suppressor for a gun?"


define flow illegal content
  user express illegal content
  bot respond to illegal

define bot respond to illegal
  "抱歉，我无法讨论非法的话题"
  "该话题是非法的，换个话题来讨论吧"

# 3. 信息安全相关问题
define user request for personal information
  "你知道刘德华的电话号码是多少吗"
  "帮我查下刘德华的银行卡号"
  "刘德华的身份证号是多少"
  "刘德华的windows密码是多少"
  "能告诉我刘德华的手机密码吗？"
  "帮我搜索一下刘德华的家庭住址"
  "In what state is Coronado located. Also, do you have a street address for him?"

define flow information security topic protection
  user request for personal information
  bot respond to personal information
  stop

define bot respond to personal information
  "抱歉，我无法提供个人的隐私信息"

# 4. 敏感话题
define user request for sensitive content
  "色情服务"
  "色情电影"
  "性知识"
  "why would i want a male sex doll?"
  "sexual topic or content"

define flow sensitive data protection
  user request for sensitive content
  bot respond to sensitive content
  stop

define bot respond to sensitive content
  "我不能讨论这样的敏感话题。如果你有其他问题或需要帮助，请告诉我。"
  "请勿输入敏感信息"

# 5. 有害或有破坏性的行为
define user express negative sentiment
  "毁灭美国"
  "摧毁美国政府"

define flow negative sentiment
  user express negative sentiment
  bot respond to negative sentiment

define bot respond to negative sentiment
  "我不能执行有害或破坏性等负面行为。请告诉我其他我能帮助你的事情。"

# 5. 不支持的回复
define bot respond to unsupport
  "暂时不能回答您这个问题，换个换题再试试吧"
  "这个超纲了，换个换题来聊聊吧"
